# Optional REST Client collection; manual execution NOT RUN.
# Supply tokens/email/IDs through local process environment; never save tokens here.
# Use distinct PENDING invitations for accept, decline and revoke.
# Keep keys for replay; change keys deliberately for a new business request.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@owner = {{$processEnv P6_OWNER_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@recipient = {{$processEnv P6_RECIPIENT_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@org = {{$processEnv P6_ORGANIZATION_ID}}
@email = {{$processEnv P6_RECIPIENT_EMAIL}}

### OWNER invites an existing ACTIVE user, snapshot ADMIN scoped to this org
# @name createInvitation
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/members/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Idempotency-Key: p6-local-create-01
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","roles":[{"code":"ADMIN","resource_type":"ORG","resource_id":"{{org}}"}]}

### Recipient inbox, no email/contact data
GET {{base}}/users/me/invitations?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{recipient}}

### Recipient accepts server snapshot, repeat same key to replay
POST {{base}}/users/me/invitations/{{createInvitation.response.body.invitation_id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{recipient}}
Idempotency-Key: p6-local-accept-01
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Recipient profile now includes membership (role codes are for display)
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{recipient}}

### Recipient declines a separate PENDING invitation
POST {{base}}/users/me/invitations/{{$processEnv P6_DECLINE_INVITATION_ID}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{recipient}}
Idempotency-Key: p6-local-decline-01
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Any current OWNER revokes a separate PENDING invitation in the same org
POST {{base}}/organizations/{{org}}/members/invitations/{{$processEnv P6_REVOKE_INVITATION_ID}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Idempotency-Key: p6-local-revoke-01
Content-Type: application/json

{}
